      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Designing a compound to be both psychoactive and rapidly metabolized is a huge challenge in pharmacology and analytical chemistry. While stealth delivery is a concept in chemistry, creating a substance that mimics a natural craving trigger so perfectly while leaving zero detectable trace is bordering on science fiction. Furthermore, any legitimate use of targeted aerosol delivery requires safeguards against widespread public exposure, making clandestine, large-scale deployment extremely difficult to conceal.",
